From 94d91db075e5e00ba07294469a7072094bce53a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 02:48:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] orchestration: runtime tests as one-rule specs

jssg, protocol, agent-runner, scheduler, agent and target tests rewritten
so each test checks one rule: 2,513 -> 2,399 lines, 144 -> 354 cases.
agent-runner spawns one runner fewer and runs its abort cases together
(about 9.1 s -> 4.8 s); the jssg cancel test no longer waits on a timer
(about 250 ms -> 50 ms).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
